{
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "strings": {
    "": {},
    "${shouldToggle} Nifro": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "${shouldToggle} Nifro"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "${shouldToggle} Nifro ${isEnabled}": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "${shouldToggle} Nifro ${isEnabled}"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@": {},
    "%@× at %lld%%, %lld%%": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "%1$@× at %2$lld%%, %3$lld%%"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@× 位于 %lld%%, %lld%%"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A WebKit content-blocking rule list, for hiding cookie banners and ads. Paste the address of a `.json` file and Nifro compiles it once and applies it to every website.\n\nNifro keeps no rules of its own: a blocklist goes stale within weeks, and keeping one working is a full-time job somebody else is already doing. Lists in WebKit's format are published by the content-blocker projects — the one your Safari extension uses can usually be exported, and several are on GitHub as a single raw `.json` file. The address has to be the raw file, not the page it is displayed on.\n\nLeave it empty for no rules at all.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "WebKit 的内容拦截规则列表，用来挡掉 Cookie 横幅和广告。粘贴一个 `.json` 文件的地址，Nifro 编译一次，然后应用到所有网站。\n\nNifro 自己不维护规则：拦截列表几周就会过期，让它一直有效是一份全职工作，而已经有人在做了。WebKit 格式的列表由那些内容拦截项目发布——你在 Safari 里用的那个扩展通常可以导出，GitHub 上也有若干现成的单个 raw `.json` 文件。地址必须是原始文件本身，不是显示它的那个网页。\n\n留空表示不使用任何规则。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A page that reloads on a timer starts over: a long page goes back to the top, and a map or a drawing goes back to wherever it opens. This puts it back — the scroll position after a reload, and the part of the page a site names after the “#” in its address, which also survives quitting. A site that saves its own position needs none of this and keeps working either way.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "定时刷新会让页面从头开始：长页面回到顶部，地图或大图回到它默认打开的地方。这个开关把它放回去 —— 刷新后的滚动位置，以及网站写在地址「#」后面的那部分位置（这一项退出应用也留得住）。本身就会保存位置的网站不需要它，开不开都照常工作。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A video page is mostly navigation, recommendations and comments. This is the address of the player on its own, so the video fills the wallpaper without cropping or hiding anything.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "视频页面大部分是导航、推荐和评论。这是播放器单独的地址，视频会直接铺满壁纸，不用裁剪也不用隐藏任何东西。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
