    "Choose Region…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择区域…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose a directory with a “index.html” file.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择一个含有「index.html」文件的目录。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose a region with “Choose Region…” in the Nifro menu: the wallpaper becomes something you can move and zoom, and where you leave it is the region. It is remembered as a place and a magnification rather than as a rectangle, so the same website works on a second display of a different shape.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用 Nifro 菜单里的「选择区域…」来选：壁纸会变成一张可以拖动和缩放的画面，你把它停在哪里，哪里就是区域。它记住的是位置和倍率而不是一个矩形，所以同一个网站换到形状不同的第二块屏幕上一样成立。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose region": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择区域"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Clear all website data": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "清除所有网站数据"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Clears cookies, local storage, caches, page thumbnails, and what each page had remembered: where it was scrolled or moved to, and how far it was zoomed in. Your websites and their settings are kept.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "清除 Cookie、本地存储、缓存、页面缩略图，以及每个页面记住的东西：它滚动到或移动到过的位置，以及它被放大到多少。你的网站和它们的设置会保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Click to edit this website.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "点这里编辑这个网站。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Clickable on the desktop": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在桌面上可点击"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Content blocking rules": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "内容拦截规则"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Continue": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "继续"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Copies this website's settings as text, ready to paste into an issue. Nearly every question about a wallpaper is decided by these, and it saves being asked for them one at a time. The address is included; the CSS and JavaScript are reported by size rather than by content, since a stylesheet can carry something private and this gets pasted in public.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "把这个网站的设置复制成文本，可以直接粘进 issue。关于壁纸的问题几乎都由这些设置决定，贴上它们就不用被一项项追问。地址会包含在内；CSS 和 JavaScript 只报行数不报内容——样式表里可能有私人信息，而这段文本是要贴到公开地方的。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Copy Settings": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "复制设置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Could not check": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法检查"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Creates a fake dark mode for websites without a native dark mode by inverting all the colors on the website.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "对没有原生深色模式的网站反转全部颜色，做出一个假的深色模式。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Crop": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "裁切"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Current Website": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当前网站"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Custom code": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "自定义代码"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Deactivate while on battery": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用电池时停用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Deactivated While on Battery": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用电池时已停用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Default display": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "默认显示器"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Delete": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "删除"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Derived from [Plash](https://github.com/sindresorhus/Plash) by Sindre Sorhus, from its last MIT-licensed release. Plash is still developed and still on the App Store; Nifro is a separate project and uses none of its branding or artwork.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "衍生自 Sindre Sorhus 的 [Plash](https://github.com/sindresorhus/Plash)，取自它最后一个 MIT 许可的版本。Plash 仍在开发、仍在 App Store 上；Nifro 是一个独立项目，没有使用它的任何品牌或美术资源。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dim while another app is in front": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "其他应用在前时变暗"
          }
        }
