            "value": "完成"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drag or scroll to move the frame · pinch to resize · Return to keep · Esc to cancel": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "拖动或滚动移动取景框 · 捏合改大小 · 回车保留 · Esc 取消"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each website can live on its own screen. “Default display” follows the choice in Settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每个网站可以待在自己的屏幕上。「默认显示器」跟随设置里的选择。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Edit": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "编辑"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Edit…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "编辑…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enable": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "启用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enabled State": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "启用状态"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Error: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "出错：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fades the wallpaper back while you work elsewhere, and brings it up again when you click the desktop. A page bright enough to enjoy when you look at it is often too loud behind a document you are reading.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你在别处工作时让壁纸淡下去，点桌面时再亮回来。一个看着舒服的网页，垫在你正在读的文档后面往往就太吵了。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Feedback Welcome": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "欢迎反馈"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Follow the system": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "跟随系统"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For a website pinned to a particular display. On, it moves to the main display until that one is plugged back in — which is what Nifro has always done, and what macOS does with an ordinary window. Off, it goes away with its display, the way the desktop picture on that screen does. Either way the website keeps the display you chose for it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "针对指定了显示器的网站。打开：它会移到主显示器上，直到那台显示器插回来 —— 这是 Nifro 一直以来的行为，也是 macOS 对待普通窗口的方式。关闭：它跟着那台显示器一起消失，就像那块屏幕上的桌面图片一样。两种情况下，网站自己记着的显示器都不会变。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For websites that do not set their own. A website with its own schedule — set in its settings — ignores this.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "供没有自己设定的网站使用。设了自己节奏的网站（在该网站的设置里）不受这里影响。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Forces the website to use its print styles (“@media print”) if any. Some websites have a simpler presentation for printing, for example, Google Calendar.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "强制网站使用它的打印样式（「@media print」），如果有的话。有些网站的打印版式更简洁，比如 Google 日历。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Freed %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已释放 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "From": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "从"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "General": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "通用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Get %@…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "获取 %@…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Get Current Website": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "获取当前网站"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Get Enabled State": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "获取启用状态"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Get Started with Nifro": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开始使用 Nifro"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Get the current enabled state of Nifro": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "获取 Nifro 当前的启用状态"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "GitHub": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "GitHub 仓库"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hide menu bar icon": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "隐藏菜单栏图标"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hold to use the page": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按住以操作网页"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far back the wallpaper sits. Browsing Mode always uses full opacity, whatever this says, because a page you are about to click should not be half transparent.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "壁纸退到多后面。浏览模式下始终是完全不透明的，不管这里设成多少——一个你正要去点的页面不该是半透明的。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How often a page goes stale is a property of the page: a calendar is wrong after fifteen minutes, a poster never is. Off follows the interval in Settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一个页面多久过时，是页面自己的性质：日历过十五分钟就不对了，海报永远不会。关闭则跟随「设置」里的间隔。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If a website requires login, you should disable this setting while logging in as the website might require you to navigate to a different page, and you don't want that to open in a browser instead of Nifro.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果网站需要登录，登录期间应该关掉这个设置：网站可能要求你跳转到别的页面，而你不希望那个页面开在浏览器里而不是 Nifro 里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you don't currently see the website, you might need to hide some windows to reveal the desktop.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果现在看不到网站，可能需要收起一些窗口把桌面露出来。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you need to access the Nifro menu, launch the app again to reveal the menu bar icon for 5 seconds.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "需要用到 Nifro 菜单时，再次启动这个 app，菜单栏图标会出现 5 秒。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Incorrect directory.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "目录不对。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Inject your own CSS or JavaScript into this website. Most websites need neither.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "给这个网站注入你自己的 CSS 或 JavaScript。绝大多数网站两个都不需要。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Invalid URL for the “add” command.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「add」命令的网址无效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Invert colors": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "反转颜色"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Is Current": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "是当前网站"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Is Enabled": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已启用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "JavaScript": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "JavaScript"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保留"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep a wallpaper when its display is unplugged": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "显示器拔掉后，保留它上面的壁纸"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep changes?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保留更改吗？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep the website above all other windows while browsing mode is active.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "浏览模式期间让网站保持在所有窗口之上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Language": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "语言"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Later": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "稍后"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Launch at login": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "登录时启动"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lets you use the page without switching to Browsing Mode. The window then stops letting clicks through, so your desktop icons sit behind it, and the page has to keep rendering.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不用切到浏览模式就能操作网页。代价是窗口不再让点击穿过去，桌面图标会被挡在后面，而且网页必须一直渲染。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Loads the page even though its certificate is not one macOS trusts. For a device on your own network — a router, a NAS, a dashboard on a Raspberry Pi — that is normal and this is the switch for it. On a page from the public internet an untrusted certificate means somebody may be reading or altering what you load, so leave it off there.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "即使证书不被 macOS 信任也照样加载。对你自己网络里的设备——路由器、NAS、树莓派上的仪表盘——这很正常，这个开关就是为它准备的。而对来自公网的页面，证书不受信任意味着可能有人在读或改你加载的内容，那里请保持关闭。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Local Website…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本地网页…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Log In": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "登录"
          }
        }
      }
    },
