      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "更多说明"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Move the wallpaper until it shows what you want. Drag or scroll to move it, pinch to zoom.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在壁纸上摆一个取景框：拖动或滚动移动它，捏合改大小。框住的部分会填满整个屏幕。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Muted": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "静音"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Never": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "从不"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Next": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "下一个"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Next website": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "下一个网站"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nifro follows your Mac's language unless you pick one here. A language that is only half translated falls back to English rather than showing anything raw.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nifro 默认跟随你 Mac 的语言，除非你在这里选一个。翻译不全的语言会退回英文，而不是显示原始标识。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nifro is open source under the MIT licence.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nifro 以 MIT 许可开源。"
